- **Enrolled act text** (`4eacbc9c`) — carries the provision: `a criminal act, except when performed under the following circumstances:`. I took a span that starts after the page-header artifact ("SEA 1(ss) — Concur 13") that the extractor dropped mid-sentence, and I kept clear of every `[deleted: …]` fence.
